window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>My name is Liam, and I was an FBI agent.</b></p> <p>Until I stepped into the world of Rylee Adamson, that is. Now, I’m a Guardian, a wolf shifter whose very design is to protect those around him at any cost.</p> <p>The battle against Orion is done, the demons banished. In their wake, there are so many innocents who have lost their lives, their families, and their way.</p> <p>Three of them are now ours to raise—the ogre triplets. Three boys I’ve come to love as if they were my own. And they are dying.</p> <p>In a race against time, I must do the impossible. Find a female ogre willing to help us save the boys. A female from a species we had believed was wiped out.</p> <p>There is one reclusive tribe left—but they aren’t sharing anything but death.</p> <p>If I am to save my boys, I must face them down; and this time I must look inside myself and find a strength I did not know was possible, without Rylee at my side. If I fail, I fail not only my boys.</p> <p>I may fail the world.</p> <p>Adapted from the novel and produced with a full cast of actors, immersive sound effects, and cinematic music!</p> <p>Performed by Chris Genebach, Troy Allan, Dominique Salvacion, LaMont Ridgell, Lily Beacon, Karen Novack, Nora Achrati, Shanta Parasuraman, Steve Wannall, Bradley Foster Smith, Robb Moreira, Niusha Nawab, Joel David Santner, Matthew Bassett, RJ Bayley, Joey Sourlis, Julian Dailey, Sura Siu, Donald Guzzi, Ryan Dalusung, Chris Stinson, Ken Jackson, Paul Reisman, Amanda Forstrom, Torian Brackett, and Wayne LeGette.</p>"; 
